{
  "name": "ai-draft",
  "title": "檢查建議的設定",
  "summary": "驗證範例 AI 建議並套用到草稿。本次錄製未呼叫外部 AI 服務。",
  "requires": {
    "displays": 1
  },
  "setup": [
    {
      "kind": "clearOverlay"
    },
    {
      "kind": "activateApp",
      "app": "Tatami"
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "app": "Tatami",
      "identifier": "gearshape"
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 600
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "app": "Tatami",
      "identifier": "description:執行引導設定…"
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "app": "Tatami",
      "identifier": "description:繼續"
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "app": "Tatami",
      "identifier": "description:繼續"
    },
    {
      "kind": "clipboard",
      "text": "{\n  \"workspaces\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Design review\",\n      \"kind\": \"workspace\",\n      \"bundleIdentifiers\": [\n        \"dev.PangMo5.DemoLab.Canvas\",\n        \"dev.PangMo5.DemoLab.Docs\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Writing\",\n      \"kind\": \"workspace\",\n      \"bundleIdentifiers\": [\n        \"dev.PangMo5.DemoLab.Editor\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Conversation\",\n      \"kind\": \"workspace\",\n      \"bundleIdentifiers\": [\n        \"dev.PangMo5.DemoLab.Chat\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Quick notes\",\n      \"kind\": \"scratchpad\",\n      \"bundleIdentifiers\": [\n        \"dev.PangMo5.DemoLab.Notes\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "kind": "chapter",
      "text": "AI 規劃 / 範例建議"
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "text": "套用 AI 建議的設定之前，先進行檢查。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "saveLayout",
      "text": "desktop"
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "app": "Tatami",
      "identifier": "description:3. 貼上結果"
    },
    {
      "kind": "expectValue",
      "app": "Tatami",
      "identifier": "text:Design review",
      "value": "Design review"
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 1300
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "text": "檢查建議的各個工作空間指派了哪些 App。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "hover",
      "app": "Tatami",
      "identifier": "description:將規劃套用至草稿"
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 2000
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "app": "Tatami",
      "identifier": "description:將規劃套用至草稿"
    },
    {
      "kind": "hover",
      "app": "Tatami",
      "identifier": "text:Design review"
    },
    {
      "kind": "assertLayout",
      "text": "desktop"
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "text": "只修改草稿，實際桌面保持不變。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 2300
    }
  ]
}
